  "name": "fmodel-rust-demo",
  "description": "A reference implementation of a restaurant and order management system showcasing algebraic domain modeling with the fmodel-rust library. It integrates Event Sourcing and CQRS architectures, utilizing PostgreSQL for append-only event storage and materialized view projections. The project demonstrates the Decider, View, and Saga patterns to achieve functional, type-safe state management in a distributed system context.",
